                <head>No. 626<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>The Foreign Ministers of the United States, France, the United Kingdom, and the
                    Soviet Union held a Four-Power Conference in Berlin beginning January 25 through
                    February 18. For extensive <pb facs="0309" n="1399" xml:id="pg1399"/>
                    documentation on the Berlin Conference, including bilateral meetings between
                    French and United States officials, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v07p1/pg_601">volume VII, Part 1, pages 601</ref>
                    ff.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
